1
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Interrogator: How did you know MacCarver had information on the American?

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Lt. MacCarver: Kellar started grilling me on Seventh Wave. I told him what I knew.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Interrogator: And what was that?

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Lt. MacCarver: Rumors, mostly. There was talk of an American running training camps in Afghanistan, a freelance guerrilla group in the Philippines with an American advisor.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Lt. MacCarver: You know, stories like that.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Interrogator: And you believed them?

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Lt. MacCarver: Not at first. But then the blanks started filling in.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Interrogator: What blanks?

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Lt. MacCarver: Operation Cleopatra.

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Lt. MacCarver: The first time I heard the name William Lennox was when I was posted in Langley.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Lt. MacCarver: Lennox was a wetworks specialist. An assassin.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Lt. MacCarver: Cleopatra was meant to prevent a terrorist bombing in the center of Cairo.

13
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Lt. MacCarver: It was a disaster.

14
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Lt. MacCarver: The bomb exploded, killed a lot of people, including Lennox—at least, that was what Division thought.

15
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Lt. MacCarver: Three months later, he turned up in Moscow.

16
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Lt. MacCarver: Two weeks after, in Seoul.

17
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Lt. MacCarver: Then Belgrade, Belfast, London… always one step ahead.

18
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Interrogator: And you think Lennox is connected to Seventh Wave?

19
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Lt. MacCarver: Connected? He started the whole thing.

20
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Interrogator: MacCarver was brought in yesterday.

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Interrogator: So how did you know she had information on the American?

22
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Sgt. Kellar: Sergeant Solomon was in our unit, tipped me off. Coincidence, that's all.

23
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Interrogator: I don't believe in coincidence.

24
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Interrogator: [What were your missions for the next operation?]

25
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Sgt. Kellar: McCarver wanted an axis of advance from the east. The plan was to cross the cemetery on the edge of Naszran and hit the steel plant on the far side.

26
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:39,000
Sgt. Kellar: We were less than a click away when we got hit.
